/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186322054 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186322509 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186322659 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186322687 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186322687 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186323391 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "6e18b7a8-1caf-5bbf-be09-d1d09a6d4c0a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186366809 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1069 "q-102701" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1071 "Given the function $f(x,y,z)=xyz-{z}^{2}$, find the equation of the tangent plane to the level surface that passes  through the point where $(x,y,z)=(2,3,1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "843be179-016c-55ad-bf04-357dd9b69f33" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366808 #edb/ref 1074 "The equation of the tangent plane to the level surface $f(x,y,z)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(2,3,1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xyz-{z}^{2})\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(xyz-{z}^{2})\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(xyz-{z}^{2})\\text{ }k \\\\  & =yz\\text{ }i+xz\\text{ }j+(xy-2z)k \\\\ ∇\\,f(2,3,1) & =(3)(1)\\text{ }i+2(1)\\text{ }j+(2(3)-2(1))k \\\\  & =3\\,i+2\\,j+4k \\\\  & =⟨3,2,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(2,3,1)\\cdot ⟨x-2,\\,y-3,\\,z-1⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨3,2,4⟩\\cdot ⟨x-2,\\,y-3,\\,z-1⟩ & =0 \\\\ 3(x-2)+2(y-3)+4(z-1) & =0 \\\\ 3x+2y+4z-16 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366810 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366811 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366812 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366813 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186366814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186366810 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366809 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ab905e04-ebcb-5bbc-8e7d-cdb57e6bb24a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366810 #edb/ref 1080 "3x+2y+4z-16=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366810 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366810 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b9d90141-bb87-557b-8f42-7d42bba3c91d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366811 #edb/ref 1080 "2x+4y+3z-10=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366811 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366811 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "152ddd87-e22d-58da-85bb-b549e713fa60" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366812 #edb/ref 1080 "2x-3y+z-11=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366812 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366812 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e03a5aca-94df-508f-a37f-bf286cd93f47" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366813 #edb/ref 1080 "5x+y+2z-11=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366813 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186366813 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e48a7bda-ef25-5ea3-836f-2a4b00051777" #edb/ref 17592186045417